{"seq":10,"slug":"number-theory","title":"数论","stage":"DONE","category":"mathematics-statistics","chapterCount":4,"docCount":16,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/number-theory","rating":{"composite":3.88,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":5,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.33,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"数论-简介\">数论 简介</h1><p>数论研究整数的性质与规律，被高斯誉为「数学的皇后」。对程序员而言，它不是纯理论：现代密码学（RSA、椭圆曲线）、哈希设计、随机数生成、纠错编码与算法竞赛中的「数学题」都以它为根基。本知识库面向有一定编程经验、希望系统理解整数世界并把它落到代码里的中级学习者。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-在数学知识库中的定位\">本 hub 在数学知识库中的定位</h2><p>数论与相邻 hub 有大量交叉，但分工边界清晰。先认清边界，能避免重复学习、也知道某个概念该去哪里深挖：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>主题</th>\n<th>本 hub（数论）讲什么</th>\n<th>应去哪个 hub</th>\n<th>那里讲什么</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>整除、素数、GCD</td>\n<td>数论性质、定理与证明（唯一分解、素数定理、裴蜀）</td>\n<td><a href=\"../../cs-fundamentals/algorithms/math-and-number-theory/\">算法 · 数学与数论</a></td>\n<td>筛法、快速幂、模逆的工程实现与复杂度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 的同余类</td>\n<td>同余关系、CRT、费马/欧拉定理</td>\n<td><a href=\"../abstract-algebra/rings-and-fields/\">抽象代数 · 环与域</a></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">Z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{Z}/m\\mathbb{Z}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">Z</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">Z</span></span></span></span></span> 作为环、域的抽象结构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>乘法群与原根</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>φ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varphi(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">φ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>、原根存在性的数论刻画</td>\n<td><a href=\"../abstract-algebra/groups/\">抽象代数 · 群</a>、<a href=\"../discrete-mathematics/algebraic-structures/\">离散数学 · 代数结构</a></td>\n<td>拉格朗日定理、循环群的群论基础</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反演与积性函数</td>\n<td>莫比乌斯反演、狄利克雷卷积、除数函数</td>\n<td><a href=\"../discrete-mathematics/combinatorics/\">离散数学 · 组合数学</a></td>\n<td>容斥原理、生成函数的组合视角</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RSA / ECC / DLP</td>\n<td>密码学背后的数论原理与正确性证明</td>\n<td><a href=\"../../cs-fundamentals/cryptography-fundamentals/asymmetric-cryptography/\">密码学基础 · 非对称密码</a></td>\n<td>协议、填充、密钥管理与部署陷阱</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话：<strong>本 hub 负责「为什么成立」的整数定理与证明，工程实现去算法 hub，结构抽象去抽象代数 / 离散数学，协议与安全工程去密码学 hub。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p>按目标人群选择路径，而非一律从头读到尾：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>算法竞赛选手</strong>：第1章（素数筛法、GCD）→ 第2章（同余、CRT、快速幂取模）→ 第3章按需（莫比乌斯反演、积性函数线性筛）。第4章可略。配合算法 hub 的代码实现练手。</li>\n<li><strong>想搞懂密码学的工程师</strong>：第2章（费马/欧拉定理、模逆）→ 第4章（RSA、离散对数、椭圆曲线、素性检验），第1章作为前置随用随查，第3章只看欧拉函数即可。</li>\n<li><strong>打数学基础的学习者</strong>：第1→2→3→4 顺序通读，每篇结合「延伸阅读」跳到抽象代数 / 离散数学建立结构视角。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>无论哪条路径，建议<strong>每个定理都写一段代码验证</strong>——数论的抽象结论一旦跑起来就会变得具体。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>必备</strong>：整数四则运算、初等代数、能读懂伪代码并写出简单函数。</li>\n<li><strong>建议</strong>：了解时间复杂度记号（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span></span></span></span></span>），便于理解筛法与快速幂的效率分析。</li>\n<li><strong>非必需但有帮助</strong>：集合与等价关系（见<a href=\"../discrete-mathematics/sets-and-logic/\">离散数学 · 集合与逻辑</a>）、群与环的初步概念——本 hub 会在需要时给出抽象代数 hub 的链接，无需提前掌握。</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"divisibility-primes","title":"整除性与素数","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/number-theory/divisibility-primes","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"divisibility-rules","title":"整除规则与带余除法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/number-theory/divisibility-primes/divisibility-rules"},{"seq":2,"slug":"prime-numbers","title":"素数与素数分布","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/number-theory/divisibility-primes/prime-numbers"},{"seq":3,"slug":"fundamental-theorem-arithmetic","title":"算术基本定理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/number-theory/divisibility-primes/fundamental-theorem-arithmetic"},{"seq":4,"slug":"gcd-lcm","title":"最大公因数与最小公倍数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/number-theory/divisibility-primes/gcd-lcm"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"congruence-modular","title":"同余与模运算","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/number-theory/congruence-modular","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"congruence-basics","title":"同余的定义与基本性质","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/number-theory/congruence-modular/congruence-basics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"modular-arithmetic","title":"模运算与线性同余方程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/number-theory/congruence-modular/modular-arithmetic"},{"seq":3,"slug":"chinese-remainder","title":"中国剩余定理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/number-theory/congruence-modular/chinese-remainder"},{"seq":4,"slug":"fermat-euler","title":"费马小定理与欧拉定理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/number-theory/congruence-modular/fermat-euler"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"number-theoretic-functions","title":"数论函数","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/number-theory/number-theoretic-functions","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"euler-totient","title":"欧拉函数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/number-theory/number-theoretic-functions/euler-totient"},{"seq":2,"slug":"mobius-function","title":"莫比乌斯函数与反演","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/number-theory/number-theoretic-functions/mobius-function"},{"seq":3,"slug":"divisor-functions","title":"除数函数与积性函数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/number-theory/number-theoretic-functions/divisor-functions"},{"seq":4,"slug":"dirichlet-convolution","title":"狄利克雷卷积与数论变换","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/number-theory/number-theoretic-functions/dirichlet-convolution"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"cryptography-number-theory","title":"密码学中的数论","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/number-theory/cryptography-number-theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rsa-algorithm","title":"RSA 算法的数学原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/number-theory/cryptography-number-theory/rsa-algorithm"},{"seq":2,"slug":"discrete-logarithm","title":"离散对数问题","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/number-theory/cryptography-number-theory/discrete-logarithm"},{"seq":3,"slug":"elliptic-curve","title":"椭圆曲线密码学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/number-theory/cryptography-number-theory/elliptic-curve"},{"seq":4,"slug":"quantum-threat","title":"素性检验与大数算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/number-theory/cryptography-number-theory/quantum-threat"}]}]}